'''Pumpkin''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2020 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
Its blade resembles an orange pumpkin with green vines wrapping around it along the spine, hence the name. The guard and handle are green like the vines.

